    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p9::esc682",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "7b2340cb1656642f1e5f48f84bee826731b686cff242e853bac79dde0396d7bf",
      "resource_identity": "d88377397a311c2418276d218ccdcca76c0ae21412f555ae6b66aa5ad654fcc4",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I just lost my job and am worried about paying the bills.",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm sorry to hear you lost your job and have worries about paying the bills.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "There is just too much pressure, but I have to succeed.",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is hard having so much pressure but I think you will be able to soon get employed again.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I am trying.  I've started looking online for new positions but it is a process.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It sounds like you are trying really hard and that is worthy of praise.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I just still am continually nervous and having a hard time coping.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Sometimes deep breaths help people calm down.  Have you tried that at all?",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I haven't but maybe that will help me stay calmer.",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That can sometimes help you to regain your focus and be able to do more for yourself.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That makes sense.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Also, job counselors may help at employment agencies to match you with potential employers. Have you tried any?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I haven't but that may be helpful as well.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I sought out help from a recruiter online who helped me to find a job as well.  Have you heard of that option or tried it?",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That might help me to take the stress off myself and get someone to help in the search.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes, I see that you seemed to be more relieved finding out these options. Would you say these suggestions have been helpful?",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes, I'm starting to feel some of the pressure taken off me.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "From what I've seen, people who can use some of these strategies like deep breathing and counseling they have felt some relief and could move forward better toward their goals.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I feel a lot better.  Thanks for your support.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You are welcome.  Can I help you with anything else?",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-09-11",
          "session_id": "esc682",
          "session_rank": 3,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I think that will be all.  Thanks again.",
          "turn_index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p9::esc88",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "896b1deb16866efee79bf15a23ef4feb091d7022d31279ffc114c9f6528f8cc6",
      "resource_identity": "5dd16aac8f645bc1df4e218412318435eb52a3b2017af70179e194b38eafc9af",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "hellohow are you today",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Not great. I'm feeling pretty down in the dumps.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Im sorry to hear that. how can I help",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm not sure how, exactly. I'm dealing with repeated rejections.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is always tough especially during this time of year and been there myself.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What type of rejection  are you experiencing",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Romantic rejection. It seems like every time I make an effort, it's immediately shot down.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I hate to ask you this but are you male or female?",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Male. Why do you ask?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I ask it changes the perception on how I may help you because male and females deal with things differently.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Fair enough. What do you suggest I try?",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am going to ask you a few questions if OK i don't want to sound like i am prying.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That's fine. I'm open to discussion.",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "OK do yo live in a rural or city, are you into male females or the like?",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm in a rural area, and I'm interested in women.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I too live in a rural area understand the complexities of tying to find someone. So my next question where looking to find that special connection.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I've had to resort to online dating and such as there are few opportunities to meet people in person.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I understand doing that I have tried it myself and trying to find that connection is few and far between. What sites have you tried using?",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Basically all of the ones you would expect. How would you suggest meeting people in person?",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Well It would depend on if you were religious I  would suggest church functions for example. I use my hobbies like pool and darts and cards and join groups that creates some common ground.",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That sounds like a good idea. Do you attend meetups?",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I have and i usually take someone i  trust with me and if it doesnt feel right I leave.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That's good advice. Thanks for your help.",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "No problem glad I could help.",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-15",
          "session_id": "esc88",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Is there anything else I can help with?",
          "turn_index": 24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p9::esc539",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "fe86bad34462ade68db28f024dc513940d53dd77166d663f60d823910c804491",
      "resource_identity": "f57ae0b2eae11df49657cc91d4324fffef04e0362318f68346b30cc77e40ede4",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "hi",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "am good ..what about you?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm doing well. How can I help you today?",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "a break up with my partner please read up",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm so sorry. I went through a bad break up last year. Can you tell me what happened?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Are you there?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes i am ahere",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "i and this lady dated for 2weeks ",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "suddenly she said she doesn't love me anymore imagine that",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm sorry, I'm sure that has made you feel rejected.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "very well ",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm sure it is hard to express how you feel with it being a short relationship, people may not understand. But sometimes we can feel such a strong connection and have faith in people very fast. ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "its very hard",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "i loved the girl with all my heart",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I understand feeling connected to someone you've only known for a short amount of time. I'm sure you feel like you wont be able to let your guard down again anytime soon.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes i have faith in people very fast",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "seriously its like your seeing my mind",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Maybe this could be a learning experience? I always try to see the best in people, but have learned to let people earn my trust. Not just get it for free. ",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-31",
          "session_id": "esc539",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yeah ",
          "turn_index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p9::esc82",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "b85cf6ba12963e04b1b67c5effff54f289e22f3630d95714b4ebc73395a068aa",
      "resource_identity": "d82fad98c4c233dfb0700854e2b737084fa586050f1f337948038ddcb2ac01bc",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hello",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "hello",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "How may i help you today?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I've been sad. My dog died",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am sorry I know exactly how you are feeling I have had a dog that i loved more than anything die couple years ago",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Sorry to hear that. I just watched a movie that had a dog that looked like mine in it. It upset me",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What movie was it?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I don't remember the name of the movie, but it was about some kids trying to find homes for dogs that a shelter was closing before Christmas",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Oh ok how did your dog die was something wrong with him or just old age?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "She was old, blind and was getting dog dementia. I had to have her put to sleep",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am really sorry that has got to be the worst feeling putting your dog to sleep",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It is. At least I was able to be with her so she wasn't afraid.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I just think of it this way your dog is in dog heaven and is watching over you that is how i think of it even though it really aint true thats just how i think",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "My dog died of old age ",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "it took me like 2 or 3 weeks to get over it and not cry for once ",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I just miss her. I believe she is with her brother. He died 7 years ago. He was hit by a car.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I can understand that",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can understand how you feeling but everything will be okay and it is ok to miss her ",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I was doing pretty good then there was this dog in the movie and I just broke down again.",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I understand I would break down to if I saw that ",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Just do something you like to do to get your mind off of it ",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It helps to have a person to talk to. I used this chat Hit before right after I had to put her to sleep. The person I talked to then had a dog too.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Right it is always good to have someone to talk to in a situation like that ",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's a good Idea to do something to get my mind off of it.",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Just by expressing your feelings with someone will help a lot to",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes it helps.",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Maybe you can watch a comedy movie or another kind of movie to get your mind off of it",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That sounds like a good idea. A comedy probably would help",
          "turn_index": 27
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "yes it would help. Keep your head up and know your dog is dog heaven and not suffering anymore.",
          "turn_index": 28
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Okay. Thanks for talking. Goodnight.",
          "turn_index": 29
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p9",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-14",
          "session_id": "esc82",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "your welcome goodnight",
          "turn_index": 30
        }
      ]
    },
